  "description": "Hazine Piri Kap\u0131s\u0131 is the Turkish name for a rock niche bearing an inscription of the Urartian king I\u0161puini, son of Sarduri I (9th century BCE). It is situated on an isolated rock near modern Elmal\u0131 (Zivistan) and Edremit.",
